WEBVTT

00:13:29.796 --> 00:13:33.276
So do you think that you are the only
person with this kind of regret?

00:13:33.676 --> 00:13:34.876
L: I don't know.

00:13:34.916 --> 00:13:36.076
DHP: Not at all.

00:13:36.076 --> 00:13:37.396
I’m watching the chat, man.

00:13:37.436 --> 00:13:40.556
Somebody said, “Lily,
you’re telling my story.”

00:13:40.876 --> 00:13:43.596
So one of the things
that we can do with our regret

00:13:43.636 --> 00:13:46.516
is treat ourselves
with self-compassion, alright?

00:13:46.556 --> 00:13:48.716
Not boost our self-esteem,

00:13:48.756 --> 00:13:50.076
that's sometimes dangerous.

00:13:50.116 --> 00:13:52.516
Not rip ourselves down
with self-criticism,

00:13:52.556 --> 00:13:53.996
but actually say,

00:13:54.036 --> 00:13:56.396
treat ourselves with kindness
rather than contempt

00:13:56.436 --> 00:13:58.436
and recognize that what
we're going through

00:13:58.476 --> 00:14:00.356
is part of the shared human experience.